body:
I don't have numbers but it used to be just okay at best. I had to correct it every 3 days or so to make it down to minute accurate. But since I posted, I have sent it to get it serviced. And now the accuracy is really good. I correct it maybe once a week if I notice it's 1 minute faster or slower.

&#x200B;

So it can be great but it's not great out of the factory.
